# The battle seen low across the plateau, the camera turning 6 degrees a second, for 25 seconds.
label turning
stage battle.stage
players 2
warmup_ticks 600
measure_seconds 25
shot_at 12
centre_x 1980
centre_z 2080
yaw 0
pitch -53
zoom 1
turn_rate 6
